Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:07:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple-g5p: pipeline render jobs two deep
 (render_user_pipeline_depth)

[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux 2be3fbe5f3c5908b604dd29002b01d1acf1b99ba;
fixed source defaults, no production module controls.] Preserve the
measured opt1 chain in dependency order.

Assisted-by: LLM
